# Customer data. These files held 15 real leads (names, phones, emails) in a
# public repo until 2026-09-15. On Vercel they are never used — src/lib/data/leads.ts
# writes to a temp dir when process.env.VERCEL is set — so tracking them bought
# nothing and leaked everything. data/services.json stays tracked: it is content,
# not customer data, and the site renders from it.
data/leads.json
data/quotes.json
